<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>中泰龙钉钉数字化平台 CXO 高管汇报</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/base.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/themes/dingtalk-collaboration.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --black: #050505;
      --black-2: #111111;
      --white: #f7f4ee;
      --muted: #bfc7cf;
      --line: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.22);
      --line-strong: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.48);
      --orange: #ff4d00;
      --orange-2: #ff8a1f;
      --cyan: #4de8ff;
      --green: #87ff9c;
      --red: #ff2c55;
      --steel: #8b96a3;
      --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);
      --panel-2: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.125);
      --radius: 6px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0; min-height: 100%;
      background: var(--black); color: var(--white);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    body { display: grid; place-items: center; }
    button { font: inherit; }
    .viewport {
      position: relative; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
      display: grid; place-items: center; overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 74%, rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.18), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 84% 18%, rgba(77, 232, 255, 0.12), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #020202, #0b0b0b 48%, #000000);
    }
    .deck {
      position: relative; width: 1280px; height: 720px;
      overflow: hidden; transform-origin: center center;
      background: #030303;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62);
    }
    #stars {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 1280px; height: 720px;
      z-index: 0; opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .slide {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; display: none;
      padding: 54px 64px; overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 80px 80px;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .slide.is-active {
      display: block;
      animation: slideIn 420ms cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1);
    }
    .slide::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.18), transparent 24%, transparent 74%, rgba(77, 232, 255, 0.12)),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), transparent 20%, transparent 76%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
      opacity: 0.62; mix-blend-mode: screen;
    }
    .slide::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); pointer-events: none;
    }
    .slide > * { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
    .notes { display: none; }
    .deck-header, .deck-footer {
      position: absolute; left: 64px; right: 64px; z-index: 4;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.72); font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .deck-header { top: 30px; }
    .deck-footer { bottom: 28px; }
    .mark {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      color: var(--white); font-weight: 850;
    }
    .mark::before {
      content: ""; width: 38px; height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--orange), var(--cyan));
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.75);
    }
    .tag {
      display: inline-grid; place-items: center;
      min-width: 88px; height: 28px; padding: 0 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.24);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.76);
      border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
    .kicker {
      color: var(--orange-2); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .h1 { max-width: 760px; font-size: 74px; line-height: 0.96; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .h2 { max-width: 760px; font-size: 54px; line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .lede {
      max-width: 620px; margin-top: 22px;
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.78); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); }
    .orange { color: var(--orange-2); }
    .cyan { color: var(--cyan); }
    .green { color: var(--green); }
    .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .grid-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .panel {
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.16);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--panel-2), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38));
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
    }
    .label {
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.55); font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 760; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .hairline {
      width: 100%; height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.45), transparent);
    }
    .slash {
      position: absolute; width: 410px; height: 760px;
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.36);
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(77, 232, 255, 0.22);
      transform: rotate(24deg); opacity: 0.75; pointer-events: none;
    }
    /* Hero */
    .hero { padding: 76px 68px 58px; }
    .hero .deck-header, .hero .deck-footer { left: 68px; right: 68px; }
    .hero-copy { position: absolute; left: 68px; top: 116px; width: 660px; }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 88px; line-height: 0.9; font-weight: 950;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .hero-title span {
      display: block; color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.9);
    }
    .hero-meta {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px;
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.78); font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .hero-visual {
      position: absolute; right: 54px; bottom: -64px;
      width: 510px; height: 700px; z-index: 2;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 28px rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.25));
    }
    .hero-visual svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }
    .burn { animation: burn 920ms ease-in-out infinite alternate; transform-origin: center top; }
    .telemetry {
      position: absolute; right: 430px; top: 112px; width: 250px; padding: 14px; z-index: 3;
    }
    .telemetry .row {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.12);
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.76);
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px;
    }
    .telemetry .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    /* Metrics */
    .metric-card {
      min-height: 130px; padding: 18px; display: flex;
      flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .metric {
      font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 920;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    }
    .metric small {
      display: block; margin-top: 8px;
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.58); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;
    }
    /* Comparison table */
    .cmp-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
    .cmp-table th {
      text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--orange);
      color: var(--orange-2); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px;
    }
    .cmp-table td {
      padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.1);
      color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.78); vertical-align: top;
    }
    .cmp-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); }
    .cmp-win { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
    .cmp-lose { color: var(--muted); }
    /* Architecture */
    .arch-layer {
      padding: 14px 18px; border-left: 3px solid var(--orange);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
    }
    .arch-layer.cyan { border-left-color: var(--cyan); }
    .arch-layer.green { border-left-color: var(--green); }
    .arch-tag {
      min-width: 72px; padding: 4px 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--orange-2); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .arch-tag.cyan { color: var(--cyan); }
    .arch-tag.green { color: var(--green); }
    /* Phase timeline */
    .phase-row {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr 120px; gap: 14px;
      align-items: center; padding: 14px 16px; min-height: 72px;
    }
    .phase-num {
      width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.2);
      color: var(--orange-2); font-weight: 900;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 16px;
    }
    /* AI scene cards */
    .ai-card {
      padding: 18px; min-height: 140px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .ai-icon {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2));
      color: #000; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    /* ROI bars */
    .bar-row {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr 50px; gap: 12px;
      align-items: center; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.72);
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    }
    .bar-track {
      height: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.16);
      border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }
    .bar-fill {
      height: 100%; border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2), var(--cyan));
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.34);
    }
    /* Closing */
    .closing { place-items: center; text-align: center; }
    .slide.closing.is-active { display: grid; }
    .closing h1 {
      font-size: 96px; line-height: 0.9; font-weight: 950;
      text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 980px;
    }
    .closing h1 span {
      color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.92);
    }
    .closing .lede { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    /* Nav */
    .nav {
      position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 22px; transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex; gap: 8px; z-index: 10; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 180ms ease;
    }
    .nav button {
      width: 38px; height: 38px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.2); border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.8); color: var(--white);
      display: grid; place-items: center; cursor: pointer;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px); box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }
    .nav button:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.7); color: var(--orange-2); }
    .nav svg {
      width: 18px; height: 18px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round;
    }
    @keyframes slideIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.99); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
    }
    @keyframes burn {
      from { opacity: 0.72; transform: scaleY(0.96); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1.05); }
    }
    @media print {
      html, body { overflow: visible; background: #000; }
      .viewport { display: block; width: auto; height: auto; overflow: visible; }
      .deck { transform: none !important; box-shadow: none; }
      .slide { display: block !important; position: relative; page-break-after: always; }
      .nav { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="viewport">
    <main class="deck" id="deck" aria-label="中泰龙钉钉数字化平台CXO高管汇报">
      <canvas id="stars" width="1280" height="720" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

      <!-- ====== SLIDE 1: 封面 ====== -->
      <section class="slide hero is-active" data-title="封面">
        <div class="deck-header">
          <span class="mark">中泰龙 × 钉钉</span>
          <span>CXO 高管汇报 / 16:9</span>
        </div>
        <div class="slash" style="right: 178px; top: -112px;"></div>
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="kicker">广东中泰龙家具集团 · 数字化转型战略</p>
          <h1 class="hero-title">智造 <span>协同</span> 新引擎</h1>
          <p class="lede">基于钉钉AI平台构建统一数字化协同底座，打通CRM/ERP/MES/WMS四大系统，以悟空AI赋能智能制造全链路，驱动43年行业龙头迈向数智化新阶段。</p>
          <div class="hero-meta">
            <span class="tag">43年龙头</span>
            <span class="tag">AI赋能</span>
            <span class="tag">四阶段落地</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="telemetry panel">
          <div class="row"><span>汇报对象</span><strong>CEO / CIO / CFO</strong></div>
          <div class="row"><span>员工规模</span><strong>≈3,000人</strong></div>
          <div class="row"><span>生产基地</span><strong>60万㎡</strong></div>
          <div class="row"><span>市场覆盖</span><strong>40+国家</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 420 660" role="img">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="shipBody" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#ffffff"/>
                <stop offset="0.28" stop-color="#8f969f"/>
                <stop offset="0.62" stop-color="#f7f4ee"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#545b63"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <linearGradient id="flame" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff7cc"/>
                <stop offset="0.28" stop-color="#ff8a1f"/>
                <stop offset="0.72" stop-color="#ff2c00"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="rgba(255,44,0,0)"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <filter id="glow">
                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="7" result="blur"/>
                <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
              </filter>
            </defs>
            <path d="M214 38 C246 78 261 122 261 190 L261 418 C261 476 238 514 214 530 C190 514 167 476 167 418 L167 190 C167 122 182 78 214 38Z" fill="url(#shipBody)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.55)" stroke-width="1.4"/>
            <path d="M175 246 L120 358 L160 386 L174 334Z" fill="#24272b" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.28)"/>
            <path d="M253 246 L308 358 L268 386 L254 334Z" fill="#24272b" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.28)"/>
            <path d="M174 418 L254 418 L245 502 L183 502Z" fill="#202225" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.24)"/>
            <path d="M188 158 C197 139 231 139 240 158 L240 188 L188 188Z" fill="#111" opacity=".75"/>
            <g stroke="rgba(0,0,0,.45)" stroke-width="1">
              <path d="M171 244 H258"/><path d="M171 300 H258"/>
              <path d="M171 356 H258"/><path d="M177 456 H251"/>
            </g>
            <g class="burn" filter="url(#glow)">
              <path d="M184 502 C174 548 174 594 214 638 C254 594 254 548 244 502Z" fill="url(#flame)" opacity=".95"/>
              <path d="M202 502 C196 538 198 572 214 603 C230 572 232 538 226 502Z" fill="#fff4c5" opacity=".88"/>
              <path d="M150 520 C105 574 82 630 68 690" stroke="#ff4d00" stroke-width="12" opacity=".25"/>
              <path d="M278 520 C323 574 346 630 360 690" stroke="#4de8ff" stroke-width="8" opacity=".18"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="deck-footer">
          <span class="muted">CONFIDENTIAL</span>
          <span class="muted">2024 Q4</span>
        </div>
        <aside class="notes">封面页：面向CEO/CIO/CFO的高管汇报，突出43年龙头地位与钉钉AI平台战略价值。</aside>
      </section>


      <!-- ====== SLIDE 2: 行业龙头地位与数字化现状 ====== -->
      <section class="slide" data-title="龙头地位与现状">
        <div class="deck-header">
          <span class="mark">中泰龙 × 钉钉</span>
          <span>01 / 企业画像</span>
        </div>
        <p class="kicker">43年行业深耕 · 全国前三</p>
        <h2 class="h2" style="font-size:42px;">行业龙头的<span class="orange">数字化拐点</span></h2>
        <div class="grid-4" style="margin-top:24px;">
          <div class="panel metric-card">
            <span class="label">创立年份</span>
            <span class="metric orange">1983</span>
            <small>43年办公家具行业深耕</small>
          </div>
          <div class="panel metric-card">
            <span class="label">员工规模</span>
            <span class="metric cyan">3,000</span>
            <small>覆盖研发/生产/销售全链</small>
          </div>
          <div class="panel metric-card">
            <span class="label">生产基地</span>
            <span class="metric">60万㎡</span>
            <small>两大智慧产业园</small>
          </div>
          <div class="panel metric-card">
            <span class="label">智能工厂投入</span>
            <span class="metric orange">10亿</span>
            <small>4.0黑灯产线已落地</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hairline" style="margin:20px 0;"></div>
        <div class="grid-2" style="gap:20px;">
          <div class="panel" style="padding:18px;">
            <span class="label" style="margin-bottom:10px;display:block;">已建系统基座</span>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <span class="tag">CRM</span><span class="tag">ERP(鼎捷)</span>
              <span class="tag">MES</span><span class="tag">WMS</span>
              <span class="tag">AI物料平台</span>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top:12px;color:rgba(247,244,238,0.6);font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">合作伙伴：鼎捷软件·三维家·数夫软件；产品远销欧美及东南亚40+国家，市场占有率全国前三。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="panel" style="padding:18px;">
            <span class="label" style="margin-bottom:10px;display:block;color:var(--red);">核心痛点量化</span>
            <div style="display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(247,244,238,0.72);">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,0.08);padding:4px 0;"><span>换线时间</span><span class="orange">4h / 产能利用率72%</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,0.08);padding:4px 0;"><span>采购周期</span><span class="orange">15-25天 / 周转4.2次/年</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,0.08);padding:4px 0;"><span>交付延期率</span><span class="orange">18% / 客诉响应&gt;48h</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,0.08);padding:4px 0;"><span>审批流转</span><span class="orange">3.5天 / 信息丢失30%</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:4px 0;"><span>新员工上岗</span><span class="orange">45天 / 流失率22%</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="deck-footer">
          <span class="muted">CONFIDENTIAL</span>
          <span class="muted">01</span>
        </div>
        <aside class="notes">展示中泰龙43年龙头地位和已有数字化基础，同时用量化数据揭示7大痛点，为后续方案铺垫。</aside>
      </section>

      <!-- ====== SLIDE 3: 钉钉 vs 飞书六维对比 ====== -->
      <section class="slide" data-title="钉钉vs飞书六维对比">
        <div class="deck-header">
          <span class="mark">中泰龙 × 钉钉</span>
          <span>02 / 平台选型</span>
        </div>
        <p class="kicker">六维度差异化评估</p>
        <h2 class="h2" style="font-size:38px;">为什么是<span class="orange">钉钉AI平台</span>而非飞书</h2>
        <div class="panel" style="padding:18px;margin-top:20px;">
          <table class="cmp-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th style="width:100px;">维度</th>
                <th>钉钉 AI 平台</th>
                <th>飞书</th>
                <th style="width:80px;">判定</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">AI 能力</td>
                <td>悟空AI原生集成：企业知识问答、文档总结、数据洞察、流程自动化；支持私有化部署</td>
